# Switches the UI to Ukrainian, walks the main menu, the stand choice, "What to export?" and the selection browser,
# then switches back to English (the language is remembered in cst.ui-state.json).
wait:main menu (English)
Down
Down
Down
Down                  # (Table data)
Enter                 # Language
wait:language choice
Down
Enter                 # Українська
wait:main menu in Ukrainian
Enter                 # Експорт
Enter                 # dev (the last source comes first)
wait:what to export
Enter                 # Вибрати
wait:selection browser
Escape                # nothing selected: back to the main menu
wait:main menu again
Down
Down
Down
Down                  # (Дані таблиць)
Enter                 # Мова
Down
Enter                 # English
Down
Down
Down
Down
Down
Enter                 # Quit
